stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> ReadDefinitions
  ReadDefinitions --> CaptureRuleFiles: router and RuleSet JSON valid
  ReadDefinitions --> Refused: invalid fields, version or pattern declarations
  CaptureRuleFiles --> ValidateRules: referenced rule files captured
  CaptureRuleFiles --> SourceFailure: unavailable or changed bytes
  ValidateRules --> CheckBindings: rules, verdicts and input references valid
  ValidateRules --> Refused: invalid, empty, duplicate or incompatible
  CheckBindings --> Admitted: every input bound once, payloads match schemas
  CheckBindings --> Refused: unbound, extra or mismatched bindings
  Admitted --> [*]
  Refused --> [*]
  SourceFailure --> [*]
